Description: Rust CPU/CUDA inference runtime for the Julia-1 decision model (CUDA build)
 julia1 runs the Supersonic Labs Julia-1 decision model (typed choice,
 score and noul questions answered in one bidirectional pass) with an
 AVX-512 CPU backend or a CUDA BF16 tensor-core backend. Point it at a
 Julia-1 checkpoint directory with --checkpoint or JULIA_CHECKPOINT. This
 build is linked against CUDA. Needs an NVIDIA GPU with compute
 capability 8.0+ and the cuBLAS runtime; SASS is built for
 sm_80/86/89/90/120. libcuda1 (installed by the NVIDIA driver package)
 satisfies the runtime link; it does not by itself guarantee
 driver/toolkit compatibility.
